{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmedla9j35k0","created":1792977817444,"text":"心血管系统疾病"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg3tkt12bk0","created":1793153376118,"text":"  动脉粥样硬化\nAtherosclerosis","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg3uf2lqbk0","created":1793153442001,"text":"概念","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg3v6h2unc0","created":1793153501649,"text":"是一种与血脂异常及血管壁成分改变有关\n的动脉疾病，主要累及大中动脉。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3y2h00oo0","created":1793153728030,"text":"基本病变是动脉内膜脂质沉积，内膜灶状纤维化，\n粥样斑块形成，致管壁变硬，管腔狭窄，\n并引起一系列继发性病变","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3ya4untc0","created":1793153744710,"text":"分开理解：粥样和硬化两个症状"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg3yjr45i80","created":1793153765647,"text":"动脉硬化\nArteriosclerosis"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg3yun65vs0","created":1793153789353,"text":"指动脉壁增厚、失去弹性、硬化性的一类疾病。"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3ugh1gz40","created":1793153445051,"text":"病因","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg3zfr46eo0","created":1793153835304,"text":"确切病因不清楚"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3zkoszqg0","created":1793153846048,"text":"危险因素"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg3zq1e8ao0","created":1793153857693,"text":"不可控因素"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg4000460o0","created":1793153879384,"text":"年龄：中老年\n性别：男＞女\n遗传因素"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmg4097cco00","created":1793153899412,"text":"可控因素"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg40e1xk600","created":1793153909968,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3ui4saeo0","created":1793153448663,"text":"发病机制","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3ujidnc00","created":1793153451662,"text":"病理变化","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3ukzc51s0","created":1793153454864,"text":"重要器官的变化","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3tnec9y80","created":1793153381761,"text":"高血压病","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3tr0bdnk0","created":1793153389620,"text":"风湿病","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3tskjn3c0","crea